          "type": "string",
          "format": "int64"
        },
        "deduplicated": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "title": "UploadSourceResponse 是上传终态：id 是后续 Deploy 的 upload_id。同字节\n重传返回同一 id（deduplicated=true）。"
